% layout 'help_macro';
% title maketext('Users Assigned to Set Help');
%
<p>
	<%= maketext('A student needs to be assigned a set in order for them to work it. Use the "Assigned" checkboxes '
			. 'to assign/unassign this set to/from the associated student. Once a student is unassigned from a set, '
			. 'all the data for them is lost and there is no way to undo it. Reassigning a set to a student will '
			. 'create new versions of all the problems for them.') =%>
</p>
<p>
	<%= maketext('Assigning sets to a large number of users can take a long time.') =%>
</p>
<p>
	<%= maketext('The "Reduced Scoring Date" and "Close Date" are only displayed for students whose date has been '
			. 'overridden from the main set. Further, the "Reduced Scoring Date" column is only shown if reduced '
			. 'scoring is enabled for the course and the main set.') =%>
</p>
<p class="mb-0">
	<%= maketext(q/Use the "Edit data for student id" links to edit that student's set data/) =%>
</p>
